# Canonicalise all text to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Every source file here is LF, but package-lock.json was historically committed
# with CRLF. npm always rewrites the lockfile with LF, so each install turned into
# a ~16k-line diff that was pure line-ending churn. Fixing the format explicitly
# also stops a global core.autocrlf=true on a Windows machine from reintroducing
# CRLF and re-creating the same noise for everyone else.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be run through text conversion.
*.glb binary